        "answer": {
          "short": "$f(x)=(x-4)(x-6)$",
          "worked": "The zeroes give factors $x-4$ and $x-6$. Since the quadratic is monic, its leading coefficient is 1.\n$$f(x)=(x-4)(x-6)$$",
